/* 导入页局部样式：沿用全局视觉令牌（主色 #1677ff / 卡片白底 / 间距 8rpx 倍数），本页仅做强化覆盖 */

.field-label {
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.field-gap {
  margin-top: 32rpx;
}

.share-input {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 160rpx;
  background: #f5f7fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

/* 内联下拉触发行：浅灰底 + 右侧箭头，与全局 picker-row 类名叠加 */
.picker-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: #f5f7fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
}

.picker-text {
  font-size: 30rpx;
}

.picker-text-set {
  color: #1f2937;
}

.picker-text-hint {
  color: #9ca3af;
}

.picker-arrow {
  color: #9ca3af;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-left: 16rpx;
}

.place-retry {
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  color: #1677ff;
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

/* "其他"展开的自定义输入面板：提示行用弱化色 #9ca3af */
.custom-panel {
  margin-top: 16rpx;
  background: #f5f7fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
}

.custom-hint {
  color: #9ca3af;
  font-size: 24rpx;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.custom-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.custom-input {
  flex: 1;
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 24rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

.custom-confirm {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  color: #ffffff;
  background: #1677ff;
  border-radius: 12rpx;
  padding: 16rpx 32rpx;
  font-size: 28rpx;
}

.plate-input {
  background: #f5f7fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  padding: 24rpx;
}

.wait-row {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16rpx;
}

.wait-chip {
  background: #f5f7fa;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  padding: 12rpx 32rpx;
  color: #6b7280;
}

.wait-chip-on {
  background: rgba(22, 119, 255, 0.1);
  color: #1677ff;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* stepper：间距取 8rpx 倍数，加减号用主色 */
.stepper {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  background: #f5f7fa;
  border-radius: 16rpx;
  width: fit-content;
}

.step-btn {
  width: 72rpx;
  height: 72rpx;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #1677ff;
  font-size: 40rpx;
}

.step-num {
  min-width: 64rpx;
  text-align: center;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #1f2937;
}

/* 提交按钮：通栏渐变主按钮（覆盖全局 btn-primary 的纯色背景） */
.submit-bar {
  padding: 24rpx 24rpx 40rpx;
  padding-bottom: calc(40rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
}

.page-submit {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1677ff, #4d9bff);
  border-radius: 20rpx;
  box-shadow: 0 4rpx 16rpx rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
}

.page-submit-disabled {
  background: #c6cbd4;
  box-shadow: none;
}
